5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the diggers will hit soft ground and the dates will slip. Who else is checking the site conditions?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good question, Kenji. I’m less worried about the diggers and more about how the ground behaves once the ribbon is cut. Who else is looking at the drainage?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m curious about who will actually look after the park every week. The rota seems very short lately.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I want to see what the last decade of our schemes actually looks like now, not just the drawings.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m concerned about the long-term upkeep costs. Who else is looking at the maintenance ledgers?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that makes sense. I’m checking the firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes to see if we can keep the park open while digging.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’m checking the drainage callouts and the weekday crossing counts. I want to see if the ground and the people actually agree with the plan.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I’m looking into the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I want to know who will really be there every week.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I’m checking the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting. I need to see what actually survived.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’m checking the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund. I need to know what this will cost the city to keep running.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Minato, that’s a great point! I’m hoping the volunteer groups can help keep things running smoothly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, the volunteer groups are a good start, but I’m worried about the sheer volume of drainage issues. Can they handle that?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, I hope so. I just want to know if there are enough people to help with the daily care.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, drainage is vital, but I’m focused on whether the structures we build actually last. Let’s see what the earlier works tell us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I hear you. But even if the structures last, the ledger shows the cost of keeping them alive. We must price that in now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, I hope the earlier works show us what to avoid. I’m still nervous about the clay subsoil, but let’s see what the firms say.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the clay is a real risk, but I’m more concerned about how the water moves once the rain starts. Let’s see what the callouts say.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Kenji, I hope the firms are careful. I just want to make sure the people who care for it are there every day.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, the clay is a risk, but the planting record shows what happens when aftercare is ignored. Let’s see what actually survived.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, the clay is a risk, but the ledger shows the cost of keeping it alive. We must price that in now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
